  "instruction": "Is Palindrome",
  "output": "    public boolean isPalindrome(int x) {\n        if (x < 0 || (x % 10 == 0 && x != 0)) {\n            return false;\n        }\n\n        int reversed = 0, original = x;\n        while (x > 0) {\n            reversed = reversed * 10 + x % 10;\n            x /= 10;\n        }\n\n        return original == reversed;\n    }",
